# Additional memory-disambiguation test: a younger load passes an unknown older store address and must replay on alias.
# Author: Ahmed Ahmed
# Assignment model: one CDB, one memory port, word branch offsets.

# of rs              Cycles in EX    Cycles in Mem    # of FUs
Integer adder           4               4                          1
FP adder                3               3                          1
FP multiplier           2              15                          1
Load/store unit         4               1               2          1

ROB entries = 64
Issue width = 1
R2=16, F20=7
Mem[16]=1

Addi R1 R0 16
Sd F20 0(R1)
Ld F2 0(R2)
Add.d F4 F2 F2
Addi R3 R0 99
